      "name": "dsh-session-toast-notification",
      "title": {
        "en": "Session Toast Notification",
        "zh": "会话事件弹窗提醒"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Desktop notification when a turn finishes, the agent asks a question or a tool call needs approval (Windows toasts; on macOS through the app window, beta and possibly misbehaving). Names the session, outcome, duration and folder; answers can be given right in the notice; per-event sounds, volume, quiet hours, taskbar blink and click-to-open are all switchable on the plugin page.",
        "zh": "一轮结束、中途提问或等待授权时弹系统通知（Windows / macOS，macOS 为 beta 版）：写清是哪个会话、什么状态、耗时多久、在哪个目录；能直接在通知里回答或授权；三类提示音、音量、静音时段、任务栏闪烁、点通知跳回会话，全部可在插件页面里开关。"
      },
